          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d54ec3dc06cabed1d7be6854ffbcad7891a2a80abc601b16c6160db3c66eb4c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ed64ed1be1094de49b16125c58769199",
      "statement": "If the issue's worktree directory already exists, preparation returns that path untouched — no prune, no `worktree add -B`, no reset or rebase — because the previous run's uncommitted work is the only copy that exists; only when the directory is missing does it prune and create the worktree from local `main`, resetting any leftover branch of the same name.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L95-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1333daf78242ff1346e331f3cca90b72c1bcd8114847c8035043e18d62eb18cf:"
