    {
      "id": "claim_80c61ec34bbc47a987ec286b41065b33",
      "statement": "ImplementSpec.RunAsync creates one chat client per job via ProviderResolver.CreateChatClient(), builds the harness agent from a fresh ImplementationAgent bound to the worktree path, creates a session that is never persisted, runs one prompt, and then ends the workflow with git.GetStatusAsync plus a LogCompleted Information line carrying the worktree path, the trimmed `git status --short`, and the agent's response text.",
