    {
      "id": "claim_8d1dd11e655741f8a65542cf9d03a275",
      "statement": "The task prompt embeds owner/repository, issue number, title, and the worktree path, and appends the raw issue body as requirements, alongside rules forbidding git commands, commits, pushes, pull requests, new dependencies, and edits outside the workspace.",
