    {
      "id": "claim_d76bfa5217a3460d8fc161b9bd05d059",
      "statement": "A successful run ends at a log line: nothing in ImplementSpec commits, pushes, creates a pull request, or calls GitHubService, so the only artifact is the uncommitted content of the worktree and the issue stays open and labeled `ready-for-agent` with no GitHub-visible record of the run.",
