    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3a39dbde329d43a78782167fc9e31df2",
      "statement": "Because ImplementSpec has no catch block, any preparation or agent exception unwinds to JobQueue, which logs `Job {Key} failed` at Error and releases the key — there is no retry and no comment, label, or close on the issue, so recovery requires a new qualifying GitHub delivery.",
