      "id": "claim_35da08fff0f94f359570ff91711e2e85",
      "statement": "Push deliveries are handled outside this workflow: ProcessPushWebhookAsync calls Git.SyncMainAsync inline inside the request without taking PrepareLock, which is why a concurrent fast-forward can collide with a worktree preparation on git's index.lock and only the losing job or delivery fails.",
