      "id": "claim_08c32d53d7144071b2633517412d13b9",
      "statement": "ImplementSpecTests exercises the preparation hop directly through the internal PrepareWorkspaceAsync seam against a real temporary repository, pinning worktree reuse with uncommitted work preserved, recreation after a manual removal, rejection of a dirty mirror, and rejection of a foreign repository — while no test covers GitHubWebhookProcessor or the end-to-end trace.",
