    {
      "id": "claim_bbf1f2ca5ab34545a0b2b2c49cf6c68e",
      "statement": "At default verbosity a dropped delivery and a dormant delivery are indistinguishable from a deduped one: all three log only the generic `Webhook IssuesEvent (issues)` line, the dedupe case adds a `Debug` line (`Implementation already running for ...`), and nothing counts or records declined deliveries, so operators must inspect the issue's state and labels or enable Debug for `Sebastian.Webhooks` to attribute the outcome.",
